title: OpenAI Platform: Project access
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows users/owners, service accounts and API keys for one project. Counts are dynamic inventory; no fixed expected totals are built in. The OpenAI Platform organization policy can alert on semantic conditions such as no owner. Project/access documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/9186755-managing-projects-in-the-api-platform.
item: OpenAI project name.
discovery: One service is discovered for each project returned by OpenAI.
